1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,951
Oxygen returns abruptly after thirty seconds.

2
00:00:07,900 --> 00:00:13,384
A small set of neurons ignites first, and potassium and spikes begin to feed each other.

3
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,878
The runaway spreads through the whole brain.

4
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:31,970
With corrected signs for antennal-lobe neurons, this short-anoxia runaway does not occur; after three minutes of anoxia, it does.

